  "fullDescription": "Pages for the planner with beautiful, bright christmas tree buffalo plaid.\n\nThe pages for the planners are ready to print.\nYou only need to download and print them on your printer.\nPlease note, if you need double-sided printing, turn the sheet\nover and print on it from the other side.\n\nThese files are for digital download only – no physical products will be sent to you.\n\nAll files are zipped in one archive. Before use, you need to unzip the zip file.\n\n-Windows users: you can right-click the file and choose to extract all.\n-macOS users: install ‘Extractor – “Unarchive Files” from the app store\n-Android users: install ‘ZArchiver’ from the play store\n-IOS users (iPhone-Ipad): install ‘Documents by Readdle’ from the app store.\n\nYou get a ZIP file which includes:\n– 2 PNG files 8.5×11 inch, 300dpi\n\nUse them the way you want to be it taking notes,\nmaking shopping lists, school stuff, holiday planning and more.\nYou can use these cute notes papers with your planner or without\nthe planner too.\n\n* Colors may differ from actual downloaded depending on\ncomputer monitor and resolution. Hence, there may be some\ndiscrepancy between how colors are displayed on the screen\nand the actual printing.\n\nThank you!\nKind regards,\nMargarita",
